# Landing zone configuration for {{ domain | md }}

This directory is the output of `lzctl render` for a {{ profile | md }} landing zone on Google Cloud. It is configuration data for the Cloud Foundation Fabric FAST baseline {{ baseline_tag | md }}, not a deployed landing zone: nothing has been created in any cloud, and `lzctl` never runs `terraform apply`.

Do not edit these files by hand. Change the landing zone spec and render again into an empty directory; `lzctl check` reports any file that no longer matches `render-report.json`.

